        ns1:worksheetRow  "2. Classes!A10:F10 | A=InformationTopic | B=A general topic or information need that a Guide can relate to | C=[BLANK] | D=CQ1, CQ2, CQ6, CQ7, CQ9 | E=[BLANK] | F=[BLANK]" .

